  },
  "question": {
    "text": "If all the six digit numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are arranged in the increasing order, then the sum of the digits in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>72</mn><mtext>th&#160;</mtext></msup></math> number is _______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "32",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Taking case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;fixing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;at first two places,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, other number can be selected in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></math>&nbsp;ways&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mtext>as&#160;number&#160;are&#160;from&#160;1-9</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;fixing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;at first two place,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, other number can be selected in<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;ways</p><p>Similarly,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, other number can be selected in<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;ways</p><p>Now fixing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Other number can be selected in<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>4</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now fixing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;in first two place,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, other number can be selected in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p>So, the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>72</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;number will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>245678</mn></math></p><p>Hence, sum will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p>"
  }
}